<title>DENMARK: Nordic Investment Bank issues new 4 pct 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Nordic Investment Bank issues new 4 pct 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Den Danske Bank on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BORROWER</p>
<p>NORDIC INVESTMENT BANK (NIB)</p>
<p>AMT 200 MLN DKK</p>
<p>COUPON 4.00</p>
<p>MATURITY 12 FEB. 2003</p>
<p>TYPE STRAIGHT</p>
<p>ISS PRICE UNDISC</p>
<p>DATE 7 FEB. 1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Aaa; S&amp;P AAA</p>
<p>TO BE LISTED ON COPENHAGEN STOCK EXCHANGE 12 FEB. 1997.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
